1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:02,960
- Do you know how a snitch usually ends up?

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,560
- No matter what they promise you,

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,960
- when you are no longer useful to them,

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,560
- they won’t keep you around.

5
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,920
- I heard Boss Aang talked about
your history with Suea Yai.

6
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,040
- Did you really kill him?

7
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,880
- I was framed.

8
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:18,160
- If there’s anything I can help with,
you can always tell me.

9
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,480
- So I can trust you?

10
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:24,600
- I guess I need to return your trust.

11
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:36,880
(Yesterday, the Thai national basketball team played their opener at the 16th Olympic Games.)

12
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:43,560
(Thailand lost to the Philippines
55 – 94 points.)

13
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:51,080
(Today, Thailand will play against the USA,
the 3-time Olympic gold medalist)

14
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:55,240
(If Thailand loses in this match, their chance
to advance to the next round is over.)

15
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:59,960
(I’d like to invite all fellow Thais
to cheer on the team.)

16
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:07,360
I’ll take the ball.
Come on.

17
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:09,280
Kheow.

18
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:10,600
Din.

19
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:11,640
Come on.

20
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:16,160
Zeng, pass the ball to me.

21
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,320
Zeng.

22
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:29,600
Zeng, what’s wrong?

23
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,920
I want Hongsen to work for me.

24
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:45,760
What job do you want him to do?

25
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,200
I can do it.

26
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,040
Hey.

27
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:52,360
Taking care of the shipment at the port
is a handful for you already.

28
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,200
Don’t chase after two hares at once.

29
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,360
Can’t you choose someone else?

30
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,920
If we lose the election,

31
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:10,040
I will need to reconsider my promise
to give you the warehouse.

32
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:16,880
Boss Aang.

33
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:20,120
You know he killed my dad.

34
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,360
I can’t work with him.

35
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:30,080
How can you be sure
that Hongsen shot him?

36
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:36,400
If I tell you I was there that night.

37
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:40,480
If I tell you that Hongsen didn’t do it,

38
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,880
and I have a clue as to who did it.

39
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,880
Go get Hongsen,

40
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:51,240
and I will tell you what I know.

41
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,920
Great. I’m feeling thirsty. Thank you.

42
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,720
Both glasses are for me.

43
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,480
I didn’t bring it for you.

44
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,880
I don’t get any water to drink.

45
00:04:59,360 --> 00:04:59,720
Hey.

46
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,520
Did you wash these clothes?

47
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,560
Didn’t you see they haven’t been washed?

48
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,520
I’ll wash them after I finish cleaning here.

49
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,040
No.

50
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,560
It’s really sunny out.

51
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,600
You need to wash them now.

52
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,520
I haven’t eaten anything today.

53
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,160
I told you.

54
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:20,400
It isn’t easy to be a gangster.

55
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:23,680
If you want to have a comfortable life,
then go home.

56
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,960
When you want to take a rest,
you can ask your big bro…

57
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,440
You can ask your siblings
to do the chores for you.

58
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:37,880
Wash them.

59
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,120
Hey.

60
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,120
Wash them for me.

61
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,240
Hurry up.

62
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,240
Fine.

63
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:05,960
Hey!

64
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:08,840
I guess I pushed it a bit too strongly. Sorry.

65
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,080
You need to wash them again.

66
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,800
You did this to mess with me.

67
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,200
Damn it.

68
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:17,800
Did you see Zeng’s face?

69
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,000
It’s like he has a disorder.

70
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:22,160
He probably has facial tics.

71
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,760
Do you see the handkerchief on his wrist?

72
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,360
He hasn’t washed for over a year.

73
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,800
There are sweat stains on it.

74
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,080
That’s gross.

75
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:30,880
He’s so gross.

76
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:34,280
Yong, come and eat with us.

77
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:35,760
Come on.

78
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:36,800
Make a room for him.

79
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:41,120
Thank you.

80
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,240
What are you talking about?

81
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,880
We’re talking about your former boss.

82
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,040
Why do you look confused?

83
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,880
We’re talking about Zeng ‘Rolling in Poop’.

84
00:06:57,840 --> 00:07:03,120
I’m curious what is good about him. Tell me.

85
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,440
Yes, tell us.

86
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,640
He has many good qualities.

87
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:06,960
Let’s stop talking about him.

88
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:07,560
Hey.

89
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:12,520
I heard that he doesn’t wipe his butt
when he takes a dump.

90
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:17,120
No one would do that.

91
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,560
It’s nonsense.

92
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:20,760
Why are you defending him?

93
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,720
You must really love your old boss.

94
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:33,360
To tell you the truth,

95
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,320
what Den says,

96
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,160
it’s true.

97
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:42,160
When he takes a dump
and doesn’t wipe his butt,

98
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:44,360
he walks like this to flirt with girls.

99
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:45,560
He puts his hand in the pocket like this.

100
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:47,360
The smell is so bad.

101
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,800
This is top secret.

102
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:50,160
He got the clap.

103
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:52,280
At night, instead of resting,

104
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:53,840
he often visits a call house.

105
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,200
Serves him right.

106
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:59,000
He’s so dirty.

107
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,800
Asshole.

108
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,200
Son of a b*tch.

109
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:19,560
Boss Aang knows how much I hate Hongsen.

110
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:23,000
He still forces me to work with him.

111
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,200
Then don’t do it.

112
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:28,000
If I don’t do it,
he won’t give me the warehouse.

113
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:30,320
He promised my dad

114
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:33,640
that he would give the warehouse
to our gang to make a living.

115
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:36,200
So we don’t need to be gangsters
for the rest of our lives.

116
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:37,720
Asshole.

117
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:39,640
Hey.

118
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,560
Without Boss Aang,

119
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:47,040
can’t your gang survive?

120
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:53,120
If he wanted to give the warehouse
to your dad,

121
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,280
he would have done it a long time ago.

122
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,800
He wouldn’t keep adding new conditions.

123
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:00,640
One more thing,

124
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,200
you are Zeng Klookfoon.

125
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,240
Many people want you to work for them.

126
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:08,120
Why do you let Boss Aang
keep pushing you around?

127
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,680
He told me he knew who killed my dad.

128
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:11,440
What?

129
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,680
He said Hongsen was set up.

130
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:15,880
He was framed.

131
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,480
If it was not Hongsen, who else could it be?

132
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,560
Damn it. Who did it?

133
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,480
Are you sure you can trust Boss Aang?

134
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,520
If Boss Aang really wants Hongsen,

135
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,600
what are you waiting for?

136
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:36,880
Let’s go beat him.

137
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:42,600
If words don’t work, we can settle with fists.

138
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,880
I’ll go get our men.

139
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:48,440
What are you going to do?

140
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:56,040
If you are scared, you can stay here.

141
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:59,600
I’m not scared, but I…

142
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,960
You want to correct your misunderstanding,
don’t you?

143
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:04,440
Me too.

144
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,880
Who killed my dad?

145
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,800
I need to know the truth.

146
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:19,600
If you are sure about this,

147
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,800
I’ll go with you.

148
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,000
That’s the spirit.

149
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:29,840
Let’s go.

150
00:10:59,040 --> 00:10:59,720
Sorry.

151
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:01,600
I didn’t see it.

152
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:13,360
You haven’t told me
why Zeng dragged you to talk that day.

153
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:19,160
I already told you
Zeng wanted me to pay back my debt.

154
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:31,000
You owe Zeng money,

155
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,200
but you use your own money
to pay for my debtors.

156
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:38,280
Why didn’t you use that money
to pay your debt?

157
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:41,200
So you don’t need
to run away from him like this.

158
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,000
Are you…

159
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:47,280
Am I what?

160
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:52,320
Are you running away for another reason?

161
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,760
If I’m going to run away, it’s because of you.

162
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:01,880
Usually, you are a man with a few words.

163
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:03,960
Why are you talking so much today?

164
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:19,800
It’s better that I talk than handle it with force.

165
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,280
Sen.

166
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,200
Zeng brought his men here.

167
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:32,160
Yong.

168
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:35,560
Come with me.

169
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,680
Did your boss run away?

170
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,640
I didn’t run away.

171
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:59,680
I was preparing food for dogs.

172
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,760
Boss Aang told me
to take you to work for him.

173
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:16,000
You will work under me starting today.

174
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:17,680
Otherwise,

175
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,160
I will beat you all up.

176
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:29,240
Ptui!

177
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:31,680
You will beat me?

178
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:33,680
Fine.

179
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:36,200
If you want to try, then do it.

180
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,280
For a guy like you,

181
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:42,240
my men will be more than enough.

182
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:43,880
Come here.

183
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:45,000
But I’m not feeling well, Kla.

184
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,320
What’s your problem?

185
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:49,000
If you can beat my man in the fight,

186
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:51,280
I will work for you.

187
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,520
What did you say, Sen?

188
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,360
Hey, Yong!

189
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:58,200
Zeng, why did your bro…

190
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:58,840
Hey!

191
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,120
Shut up!

192
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:04,280
All of you, shut up.

193
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:05,760
I don’t want to talk to you.

194
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,320
I’ll hit you.

195
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:13,320
And you, Zeng.

196
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:16,040
Don’t drag other people
into the problem between us.

197
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,520
Let’s deal with it alone. Come on.

198
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:20,880
Come on.

199
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:24,080
Yong

200
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:27,480
What are you doing here?

201
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:29,240
I need to talk to Hongsen.

202
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:31,120
Why didn’t you go
and meet him somewhere else?

203
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:33,880
Why did you bring your men here?

204
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:36,880
If they find out that I’m your brother,
I will be in big trouble.

205
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,640
I want Hongsen to work for me.

206
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:40,800
So you will work for me as well.

207
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:42,880
I won’t do it.

208
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:45,520
He’s helping me find Mom.

209
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:48,880
Take your men back.

210
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:52,200
You don’t help me, and now you’re ruining it.

211
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:57,520
What’s wrong with you?

212
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:58,720
What the hell is wrong with you?

213
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:02,840
You know f*cking nothing.

214
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:05,720
I’m trying to protect what our dad built.

215
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:07,960
If I can’t make Hongsen work for me,

216
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,000
Boss Aang won’t give me the warehouse.

217
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:13,360
Dad was growing the warehouse.

218
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:16,400
Because he wanted our gang members
to have a job.

219
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:21,520
Don’t you want to see Mom?

220
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:25,320
Why do you want to see
the women who left us?

221
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:32,240
You need to go back.

222
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,280
And leave me alone.

223
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:40,400
Yong, listen to me.

224
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:54,280
Your brother is just like you.

225
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:57,240
He is not a quitter.

226
00:15:58,160 --> 00:16:01,480
Even though he’s not a gangster,
he’s got guts.

227
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,560
He’s like me?

228
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:07,440
I don’t get
why he wants to see Mom so badly.

229
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:08,520
Hey.

230
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:11,920
What about you?

231
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:18,240
Why do you want to protect the gang
and the warehouse so badly?

232
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,480
Your brother probably
doesn’t understand you either.

233
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:27,080
You have your own reason.

234
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:28,880
He has his own reason.

235
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,320
Try to understand him.

236
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:33,760
Why do I have to be the only one
who tries to understand?

237
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,200
Because you are his big brother.

238
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,600
You need to carry more of the burden.

239
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:50,720
You are taking his side.

240
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:52,920
You are so stubborn.

241
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,760
I am helping you.

242
00:16:56,160 --> 00:16:57,120
One more thing,

243
00:16:57,920 --> 00:17:01,160
I’m always on your side.

244
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:06,080
Yong doesn’t like gangsters.

245
00:17:06,760 --> 00:17:09,080
But you force him to do what you want.

246
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:10,760
That’s why he hates you.

247
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:16,880
Fine.

248
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:21,880
If you want to help me,
then tell me what I should do.

249
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,680
Let me ask you something.

250
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,840
You need to tell me the truth.

251
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:38,120
Why do you want Hongsen
to work for you so badly?

252
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:42,400
Because I want to know who killed my dad.

253
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:44,840
He needs to be punished.

254
00:17:45,040 --> 00:17:45,880
Not…

255
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:49,920
Deep down,

256
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:53,000
you think Hongsen didn’t do it, didn’t you?

257
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:57,120
If he didn’t do it,

258
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,840
it means you have misunderstood him
all this time.

259
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:02,360
You didn’t trust your friend enough,

260
00:18:02,360 --> 00:18:05,120
and he ended up serving time in prison
for the crime he didn’t commit.

261
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:08,520
You are feeling guilty.

262
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:10,720
So you want to hear the truth from Boss Aang.

263
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:16,320
Stop rambling.

264
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:18,040
Just tell me what I need to do.

265
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:25,080
You just need to find a way to beat Hongsen
without stirring things up.

266
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:27,320
And try not to make Yong hate you even more.

267
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:29,560
How can I do that?

268
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:37,000
What were you talking to Zeng about?

269
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:39,800
It’s nothing, Sen.

270
00:18:41,120 --> 00:18:42,040
Can you let him go?

271
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:42,960
Are you crazy?

272
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,360
He came to disrespect me on my turf.

273
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,600
If I let him walk out easily,

274
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,040
it will ruin my reputation.

275
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:52,160
Den, did you have the gear ready?

276
00:18:53,120 --> 00:18:53,960
Yes.

277
00:18:59,800 --> 00:19:00,480
Sen.

278
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:04,080
Do you really need to use a gun?

279
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:05,880
Please calm down.

280
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:09,720
I can surely beat you in a fight.

281
00:19:11,560 --> 00:19:12,600
But I’m a fair person.

282
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,640
I’ll compete against you fairly.

283
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:21,600
You sure talk big.

284
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:23,000
Fine.

285
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:24,680
What do you want to do?

286
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:31,880
Since our national basketball team
is qualified for the Olympic Games.

287
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:34,200
I challenge you to a basketball game.

288
00:19:37,560 --> 00:19:40,680
We will compete in teams of two.
The team that reaches 21 points first wins.

289
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,720
If you lose,

290
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:50,800
you and all your men will submit to me.

291
00:19:55,840 --> 00:19:57,040
If I win,

292
00:20:00,520 --> 00:20:02,200
you will bow your head to me.

293
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:12,320
Do you want a new servant
to wash underwear for you?

294
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:15,160
How about your old boss?

295
00:20:20,120 --> 00:20:21,680
I washed clothes.

296
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:22,800
I need to hang them.

297
00:20:22,800 --> 00:20:23,440
Hey.

298
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,480
You can’t go anywhere.

299
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:31,840
Because you will compete in the game
with me.

300
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:48,920
Are you stupid, Zoe?

301
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:50,960
We outnumber them.

302
00:20:51,280 --> 00:20:52,440
Why didn’t we just beat them in a fight?

303
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:53,960
Why did you suggest a basketball game?

304
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:55,960
What would you do if we lose?

305
00:20:58,080 --> 00:20:59,040
I suggested it.

306
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:01,480
If you want to scold someone, scold me.

307
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:06,000
No, I’m just worried

308
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:09,640
that Boss Aang won’t give you
the warehouse as he promised.

309
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,200
Do you think I will lose?

310
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:15,960
Huh?

311
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,720
Hongsen is acting strange.

312
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:23,920
Yong doesn’t know how to play basketball.

313
00:21:24,280 --> 00:21:25,320
Why did he pick him to play?

314
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:27,200
Sen, I don’t know how to play basketball.

315
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:29,440
Why don’t you pick Den instead?

316
00:21:29,760 --> 00:21:30,920
It’s good that he doesn’t know how to play.

317
00:21:31,560 --> 00:21:32,720
So we can beat them easily.

318
00:21:35,560 --> 00:21:37,080
I can beat them by myself.

319
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:39,560
Then I don’t need to play.

320
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:42,120
The rule is that each team has two players.

321
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:45,040
Don’t underestimate Sen.

322
00:21:45,360 --> 00:21:46,400
He’s smarter than you think.

323
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:50,200
You know him well.

324
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,600
He also knows you well.

325
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:54,160
Then you can’t make any mistakes.

326
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,640
Why are you trying
to pick a fight with me all day?

327
00:21:59,840 --> 00:22:01,040
I’m picking a fight with you?

328
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:04,760
Or did you do something wrong?

329
00:22:05,080 --> 00:22:06,400
Why would I pick a fight with you?

330
00:22:11,320 --> 00:22:12,080
Zoe.

331
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:15,120
This game is very important to me.

332
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:18,680
I need to win.

333
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:20,000
Alright.

334
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,800
I’ll help you win the game.

335
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:24,600
If I lose,

336
00:22:25,080 --> 00:22:26,560
I will have to work for Zeng.

337
00:22:27,440 --> 00:22:28,600
If I win,

338
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:32,160
he will bow his head to me.

339
00:22:32,280 --> 00:22:33,800
I will humiliate him
in front of everyone in Phra Nakorn.

340
00:22:35,440 --> 00:22:37,760
Do you want me to win or lose?

341
00:22:40,600 --> 00:22:41,320
I…

342
00:22:45,600 --> 00:22:46,880
Will you help me?

343
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,600
Or will you help your old boss?

344
00:22:58,440 --> 00:22:59,320
Let’s go.

345
00:23:17,240 --> 00:23:18,920
You can practice calling me your boss.

346
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:20,280
So your voice won’t crack.

347
00:23:25,560 --> 00:23:26,680
Don’t forget to bow to me nicely.

348
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:28,480
Maybe you will qualify for the Olympic Games.

349
00:23:48,080 --> 00:23:48,880
Sorry.

350
00:23:49,560 --> 00:23:51,000
The game is too fast. I can’t keep up.

351
00:23:58,800 --> 00:23:59,400
Sen.

352
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:06,880
KLOOKFOON: 5 POINTS

353
00:24:09,280 --> 00:24:10,200
Sorry.

354
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:26,560
KLOOKFOON: 10 POINTS

355
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:01,560
Come on, Sen.

356
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:03,840
Hey!

357
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:08,760
You can’t catch the ball?

358
00:25:09,720 --> 00:25:11,000
Can’t you play better?

359
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:11,480
Hey!

360
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:36,680
Yong.

361
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,400
GAOYOD: 15 POINTS

362
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,960
Yong, shoot.

363
00:26:02,520 --> 00:26:05,000
Asshole, can’t you be more careful?

364
00:26:05,080 --> 00:26:05,600
Hey.

365
00:26:06,400 --> 00:26:07,120
Calm down, Zeng.
Look at what he did.

366
00:26:07,600 --> 00:26:08,080
Hey!

367
00:26:08,960 --> 00:26:10,160
Focus on the game.

368
00:26:20,560 --> 00:26:22,760
GAOYOD: 18 POINTS

369
00:26:31,040 --> 00:26:32,120
Damn it!

370
00:26:52,040 --> 00:26:52,520
Hey!

371
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:55,000
Zeng, if you want to win this game,

372
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:56,920
you need to keep your cool.

373
00:27:01,040 --> 00:27:01,800
Calm down.

374
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:02,720
Hey.

375
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:11,320
Yong.

376
00:27:12,800 --> 00:27:13,360
Yong.

377
00:27:38,400 --> 00:27:40,880
GAOYOD: 21 POINTS

378
00:27:40,880 --> 00:27:42,400
GAOYOD 21: 19 KLOOKFOON

379
00:27:48,840 --> 00:27:50,400
What the hell are you doing, Hongsen?

380
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:54,520
I should be the one who asks you.

381
00:27:54,840 --> 00:27:55,520
What the hell did you think,

382
00:27:55,520 --> 00:27:57,000
sending your brother to join my gang?

383
00:28:03,280 --> 00:28:03,680
Sen.

384
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:15,400
Take your brother back
and don’t ever set foot on my turf again.

385
00:28:19,320 --> 00:28:19,760
Sen.

386
00:28:20,800 --> 00:28:21,400
Sen.

387
00:28:50,760 --> 00:28:51,800
Damn it.

388
00:28:53,760 --> 00:28:55,520
If you didn’t miss that shot,
we would have won.

389
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:56,640
What are you going to do now?

390
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:57,600
We will lose the warehouse.

391
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:58,840
Damn you.
Hey.

392
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:03,000
It’s not Zoe’s fault. It’s my mistake.

393
00:29:07,520 --> 00:29:08,800
I promised you

394
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:11,600
that I would give you a better life.

395
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:14,840
I said you wouldn’t have to be a gangster
for the rest of your life.

396
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:17,720
But I failed.

397
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:21,840
I’m sorry.

398
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:23,120
Calm down, Zeng.

399
00:29:24,280 --> 00:29:25,440
Don’t assume the worst yet.

400
00:29:27,280 --> 00:29:28,120
I think…

401
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:31,360
we can still negotiate with Boss Aang.

402
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:33,440
He’s right.

403
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:35,560
You’ve been working for him for a long time.

404
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:37,520
You dedicated yourself
physically and emotionally to him.

405
00:29:38,080 --> 00:29:40,280
I’m sure he won’t be too harsh on you.

406
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:43,000
That’s right.

407
00:29:43,760 --> 00:29:45,600
Don’t be too worried about it.

408
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:47,000
Let’s go eat dinner.

409
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:48,280
Things will be alright.

410
00:29:48,760 --> 00:29:49,880
I’ll cook for you.

411
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:51,160
Come on, Zeng, Din, and Zoe.

412
00:29:51,520 --> 00:29:51,880
Let’s go.

413
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:53,000
Come on, Zeng.
Stop worrying about it.

414
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:54,320
Let’s go eat dinner.

415
00:29:54,680 --> 00:29:55,320
Come on.

416
00:29:57,560 --> 00:29:58,080
Don’t worry.

417
00:30:03,440 --> 00:30:05,640
HONGSEN GARAGE

418
00:30:06,080 --> 00:30:06,880
Sen.

419
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:08,480
Sen.

420
00:30:09,280 --> 00:30:10,640
Sen, please come out. We need to talk.

421
00:30:12,080 --> 00:30:13,960
Sen, please let me explain.

422
00:30:14,520 --> 00:30:15,240
Sen.

423
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:18,280
Sen.

424
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:27,520
Thank you.
Hey.

425
00:30:30,280 --> 00:30:31,600
What do you have to say?

426
00:30:32,920 --> 00:30:34,040
Sen trusted you.

427
00:30:34,480 --> 00:30:35,200
He believed you.

428
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:39,920
You lied to him and spied on us.

429
00:30:40,320 --> 00:30:41,600
What are you snooping around for now?

430
00:30:41,960 --> 00:30:42,360
Go away!

431
00:30:43,880 --> 00:30:46,480
It’s not like that. Please let me explain, Den.

432
00:30:46,520 --> 00:30:47,520
Please let me talk to Sen.
Hey.

433
00:30:48,520 --> 00:30:51,480
If you don’t leave, I will beat you up.

434
00:30:52,280 --> 00:30:52,880
Go away.

435
00:30:54,280 --> 00:30:55,160
Please, Kla.

436
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:57,640
Please give me a minute to talk to him.

437
00:30:59,760 --> 00:31:01,120
Get the hell out of here.

438
00:31:03,920 --> 00:31:05,480
Kla, it’s not what you think.

439
00:31:07,040 --> 00:31:07,440
Sen.
Go away.

440
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:09,760
Sen
Leave!

441
00:31:11,160 --> 00:31:11,960
Go away.

442
00:31:17,280 --> 00:31:17,800
Kla.

443
00:31:18,360 --> 00:31:18,880
Kla.

444
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:21,720
Go away.

445
00:31:49,840 --> 00:31:50,520
Here.

446
00:31:51,360 --> 00:31:53,240
Din told me you like soy milk.

447
00:31:56,960 --> 00:31:57,600
I don’t want to drink it.

448
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:00,920
I…

449
00:32:05,280 --> 00:32:06,280
I let everyone down.

450
00:32:17,680 --> 00:32:18,800
If I were you,

451
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:22,280
you and your dad have been working
for Boss Aang,

452
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:28,520
hoping that you will own this place one day,

453
00:32:31,520 --> 00:32:32,880
I would be disappointed like you.

454
00:32:35,800 --> 00:32:37,520
Can I ask you something, Zeng?

455
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:40,840
Without this place,

456
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:43,280
can our gang make it on our own?

457
00:32:43,600 --> 00:32:44,200
That’s…

458
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:45,400
We will survive.

459
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:51,160
We will find a way to adapt to a new life,

460
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:56,520
Why are you carrying this burden?

461
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:04,200
Here.

462
00:33:15,760 --> 00:33:17,360
Drink it up and go to bed.

463
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:20,520
We can go talk to Boss Aang tomorrow.

464
00:33:22,440 --> 00:33:24,440
I’m sure he will give you another chance.

465
00:33:25,320 --> 00:33:26,440
Trust me.

466
00:33:36,080 --> 00:33:36,800
Zoe.

467
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,840
Where did you get that confidence?

468
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:48,880
From you, Zeng Klookfoon.

469
00:33:51,120 --> 00:33:52,920
Otherwise, I wouldn’t be working for you.

470
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:13,480
Dumbass!

471
00:34:14,920 --> 00:34:16,840
I told you to take Hongsen to me.

472
00:34:17,520 --> 00:34:18,800
I didn’t tell you to play ball.

473
00:34:24,920 --> 00:34:26,520
You lost to him in the game.

474
00:34:27,640 --> 00:34:29,040
You ruined your reputation.

475
00:34:29,320 --> 00:34:29,800
Huh?

476
00:34:30,400 --> 00:34:31,720
You also ruined my reputation.

477
00:34:34,840 --> 00:34:38,080
You can stop thinking about the warehouse.

478
00:34:38,080 --> 00:34:39,080
I won’t give it to you.

479
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:42,440
Boss Aang.

480
00:34:42,920 --> 00:34:44,080
I admit I made a mistake.

481
00:34:45,160 --> 00:34:46,280
Please give me another chance.

482
00:34:47,720 --> 00:34:51,520
This time, I will bet my life on it.

483
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:54,280
Bet your life on it?

484
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:54,920
Huh?

485
00:34:55,760 --> 00:34:57,040
Your life means nothing.

486
00:34:58,720 --> 00:35:00,120
You should have forced him to come to me,

487
00:35:00,120 --> 00:35:01,240
but you didn’t.

488
00:35:01,720 --> 00:35:02,560
You, idiot!

489
00:35:04,000 --> 00:35:05,640
The election is around the corner.

490
00:35:06,840 --> 00:35:10,160
I need more men to control the area
and monitor canvassers.

491
00:35:11,160 --> 00:35:12,040
Can you do all that?

492
00:35:14,760 --> 00:35:15,760
Then you should quit.

493
00:35:22,560 --> 00:35:25,320
If you think Zeng can’t do it or can’t do it well,

494
00:35:27,680 --> 00:35:28,760
Zeng, you should resign.

495
00:35:29,880 --> 00:35:31,600
He can find someone else to do it.

496
00:35:33,720 --> 00:35:34,160
Hey.

497
00:35:35,080 --> 00:35:35,920
Who are you?

498
00:35:38,160 --> 00:35:39,080
He’s my new member.

499
00:35:39,480 --> 00:35:39,960
He recently joined us.

500
00:35:40,280 --> 00:35:41,040
He doesn’t know anything.

501
00:35:42,080 --> 00:35:43,320
I know what’s going on.

502
00:35:44,520 --> 00:35:46,520
You want Hongsen to work for you.

503
00:35:47,480 --> 00:35:48,480
You ordered Zeng to help you.

504
00:35:49,960 --> 00:35:51,600
If he can’t do it,

505
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:54,400
no one else in this world can do it.

506
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:57,920
If you don’t give him another chance,

507
00:35:58,520 --> 00:35:59,280
that’s fine.

508
00:36:00,080 --> 00:36:01,520
Your chance to succeed is over.

509
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:02,840
You can forget about it.

510
00:36:03,480 --> 00:36:04,000
Hey.

511
00:36:04,880 --> 00:36:06,280
You can forget about it.

512
00:36:06,640 --> 00:36:08,040
You don’t know what I’m capable of.

513
00:36:10,240 --> 00:36:11,400
Boss Aang.

514
00:36:11,760 --> 00:36:13,840
I think you don’t know yourself well enough.

515
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:17,280
Why would Hongsen want to work for you?

516
00:36:18,240 --> 00:36:19,760
Are you more special than others?

517
00:36:22,280 --> 00:36:25,880
Do you have money, power, or influence?

518
00:36:28,920 --> 00:36:30,760
Many people have them.

519
00:36:32,240 --> 00:36:35,920
The only thing that you have but others don’t

520
00:36:38,760 --> 00:36:39,600
is Zeng.

521
00:36:41,640 --> 00:36:46,000
Zeng is the only one
who can make Hongsen work for you.

522
00:36:55,320 --> 00:36:58,080
You are being too nice.

523
00:36:58,760 --> 00:37:00,520
Why don’t you tell him your plan?

524
00:37:01,840 --> 00:37:04,880
Boss Aang is not someone
who can figure it out by himself.

525
00:37:05,640 --> 00:37:06,920
Son of a b*tch.

526
00:37:11,440 --> 00:37:12,000
Come on.

527
00:37:12,560 --> 00:37:15,640
You sent your man to spy on them.

528
00:37:17,240 --> 00:37:18,680
That kid.

529
00:37:23,920 --> 00:37:24,400
Right.

530
00:37:26,200 --> 00:37:28,120
I sent my man into Hongsen’s gang.

531
00:37:29,520 --> 00:37:31,280
I didn’t tell you
because I didn’t want to ruin the plan.

532
00:37:32,160 --> 00:37:35,480
Don’t ask me what the plan is.
You just wait and see the result.

533
00:37:38,000 --> 00:37:38,760
What are you going to do?

534
00:37:39,960 --> 00:37:41,760
Will you give him another chance or fire him?

535
00:37:42,760 --> 00:37:43,600
Just tell us.

536
00:37:50,640 --> 00:37:53,320
If you insist that
you won’t give me the warehouse,

537
00:37:54,040 --> 00:37:55,200
I will quit.

538
00:37:55,880 --> 00:37:57,480
As the election is coming up,

539
00:37:57,800 --> 00:37:59,840
I’m sure you can find gangsters
to work for you.

540
00:38:02,240 --> 00:38:06,480
But you won’t know
if they will be as good as Zeng.

541
00:38:13,680 --> 00:38:15,720
You take too long. I’ll decide it for you.

542
00:38:16,080 --> 00:38:16,800
I’ll quit.
Let’s go.

543
00:38:18,800 --> 00:38:19,160
Hey.

544
00:38:21,120 --> 00:38:22,120
Don’t be so hasty.

545
00:38:32,120 --> 00:38:32,960
Yes, Boss Aang.

546
00:38:38,160 --> 00:38:39,040
Cheers.

547
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:48,440
Zoe, how did you come up with that?

548
00:38:48,440 --> 00:38:50,160
You are quick-witted.

549
00:38:50,160 --> 00:38:51,560
I really respect you.

550
00:38:53,200 --> 00:38:54,560
Don’t need to respect me.

551
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:58,160
Next time,
you need to come up with a plan yourself.

552
00:38:59,200 --> 00:39:00,640
There.

553
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:03,120
Eat it.

554
00:39:04,200 --> 00:39:05,520
I’ll give you a pass just for today.

555
00:39:07,560 --> 00:39:08,280
Zeng.

556
00:39:09,680 --> 00:39:12,400
If Boss Aang doesn’t give you the warehouse,
it’s okay.

557
00:39:14,040 --> 00:39:15,920
You don’t need to carry everyone
on your shoulders.

558
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:19,120
We are family.

559
00:39:20,200 --> 00:39:22,480
Even if we don’t have the warehouse,
we won’t die.

560
00:39:30,680 --> 00:39:31,360
Thanks.

561
00:39:37,920 --> 00:39:39,840
I’ve got to go. See you later.

562
00:39:40,320 --> 00:39:41,240
Excuse me.

563
00:39:50,600 --> 00:39:51,760
Thank you too.

564
00:39:58,640 --> 00:39:59,720
I should apologize to you.

565
00:40:00,520 --> 00:40:03,320
I shouldn’t have suggested
the basketball game.

566
00:40:04,440 --> 00:40:05,040
It’s okay.

567
00:40:05,680 --> 00:40:06,080
Cheers.

568
00:40:16,000 --> 00:40:18,000
Do you have a way to recruit Hongsen?

569
00:40:20,640 --> 00:40:21,320
No.

570
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:23,800
But I’m sure I can do it.

571
00:40:25,040 --> 00:40:25,600
Why?

572
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:36,720
Because I have you.

573
00:40:41,320 --> 00:40:42,280
I mean it.

574
00:40:43,280 --> 00:40:48,480
When you are with me,
I feel like anything is possible.

575
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:51,920
I’m so lucky to have you.

576
00:41:01,160 --> 00:41:02,760
You talk too much. Eat this.

577
00:41:14,600 --> 00:41:15,480
I got it.

578
00:41:16,120 --> 00:41:16,880
Got what?

579
00:41:18,600 --> 00:41:19,880
Her house number.

580
00:41:26,760 --> 00:41:28,480
What?

581
00:41:32,960 --> 00:41:35,320
I got her house number,
but I forgot to ask the road name.

582
00:41:36,880 --> 00:41:37,600
I’ll be right back.

583
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:39,520
I need to ask her the name of the road.

584
00:41:44,880 --> 00:41:47,200
I ALSO GOT YOUR BACK.

585
00:41:58,400 --> 00:41:58,880
Who’s that?

586
00:42:10,680 --> 00:42:12,080
Get the hell out of here.

587
00:42:14,400 --> 00:42:17,240
I won’t go anywhere until I talk to you.

588
00:42:19,520 --> 00:42:20,720
You’ve known all along

589
00:42:21,080 --> 00:42:22,280
that I’m Zeng’s brother, haven’t you?

590
00:42:27,000 --> 00:42:29,240
That’s why you mess with me
by ordering me around.

591
00:42:30,640 --> 00:42:31,400
Did you have fun?

592
00:42:32,880 --> 00:42:33,760
I gave you many chances.

593
00:42:34,560 --> 00:42:35,760
I asked you many times,

594
00:42:36,160 --> 00:42:37,240
but you chose to hide it from me.

595
00:42:37,440 --> 00:42:38,480
What do you want to say?

596
00:42:40,320 --> 00:42:41,240
If I told you,

597
00:42:42,160 --> 00:42:43,680
would you still help me look for my mom?

598
00:42:44,760 --> 00:42:45,600
Look for your mom?

599
00:42:47,800 --> 00:42:49,400
I mean it when I told you
that I was looking for my mom.

600
00:42:51,200 --> 00:42:52,520
I really need your help.

601
00:42:55,240 --> 00:42:56,200
I don’t believe you.

602
00:42:56,800 --> 00:43:00,200
Go back and tell your brother to be a man.

603
00:43:00,720 --> 00:43:02,080
Don’t use this dirty trick again.

604
00:43:04,160 --> 00:43:05,400
This has nothing to do with Zeng.

605
00:43:08,400 --> 00:43:10,800
You didn’t tell me that you killed my dad too.

606
00:43:12,960 --> 00:43:13,840
I didn’t do it.

607
00:43:14,240 --> 00:43:16,680
I also didn’t know
that you were Zeng’s brother.

608
00:43:16,960 --> 00:43:17,880
And why do I need to tell you?

609
00:43:19,040 --> 00:43:19,600
You are lying.

610
00:43:19,840 --> 00:43:20,680
I’m telling the truth.

611
00:43:20,680 --> 00:43:21,760
I’m telling the truth too.

612
00:43:22,640 --> 00:43:23,560
Are you trying to get on my nerves?

613
00:43:30,120 --> 00:43:32,000
I didn’t know how my dad died.

614
00:43:33,040 --> 00:43:34,480
I didn’t know about your criminal case.

615
00:43:34,560 --> 00:43:36,160
I didn’t know a damn thing.

616
00:43:36,960 --> 00:43:38,920
Isn’t it obvious
that I didn’t come here to spy on you?

617
00:43:42,680 --> 00:43:44,800
When I told you
I believed that you didn’t do it,

618
00:43:45,400 --> 00:43:46,760
I really meant it.

619
00:43:48,880 --> 00:43:50,680
Because the Hongsen that I know

620
00:43:51,440 --> 00:43:53,240
is not someone who can kill anyone
without a reason.

621
00:43:56,000 --> 00:43:58,400
Before the game,
you asked me if I would help you or Zeng.

622
00:43:59,600 --> 00:44:00,760
You already got the answer.

623
00:44:03,240 --> 00:44:04,400
I trust you.

624
00:44:05,000 --> 00:44:06,240
I’m on your side.

625
00:44:06,640 --> 00:44:07,760
I’m always clear about my stance.

626
00:44:09,600 --> 00:44:10,680
What about you?

627
00:44:12,000 --> 00:44:13,200
Why don’t you trust me?

628
00:44:56,880 --> 00:44:58,120
I’m going to a soy milk shop.

629
00:45:11,840 --> 00:45:12,480
Coming?

630
00:45:16,920 --> 00:45:17,600
Will you come or not?

631
00:45:17,920 --> 00:45:19,040
Are you asking me or not?

632
00:45:26,640 --> 00:45:27,840
Yes, I’m asking you.

633
00:45:40,880 --> 00:45:41,200
Ouch.

634
00:45:42,880 --> 00:45:43,880
Why'd you stop all of a sudden?

635
00:45:46,720 --> 00:45:50,000
The comb that I gave you,
do you have it with you?

636
00:46:09,040 --> 00:46:09,480
Hey.

637
00:46:14,760 --> 00:46:15,320
What?

638
00:46:32,880 --> 00:46:34,360
You are now a member of the Gaoyod Gang.

639
00:46:34,800 --> 00:46:35,880
You always have to look good.

640
00:46:39,760 --> 00:46:40,600
So you are not mad at me anymore?

641
00:46:42,720 --> 00:46:43,920
I didn’t say that.

642
00:46:50,480 --> 00:46:51,880
Since you believe me,

643
00:46:53,800 --> 00:46:55,160
I will believe you for once.

644
00:47:08,520 --> 00:47:09,000
Let’s go.

645
00:47:09,600 --> 00:47:10,400
Otherwise, the soy milk might be sold out.

646
00:47:16,880 --> 00:47:17,440
Come on.

647
00:47:18,160 --> 00:47:18,640
Let’s go.

648
00:47:19,800 --> 00:47:20,160
Hurry up.

649
00:47:20,800 --> 00:47:21,240
Yes.

650
00:47:25,400 --> 00:47:26,440
Watch your step.

651
00:47:27,520 --> 00:47:28,520
Tan-tan.

652
00:47:29,800 --> 00:47:31,120
Stop joking around, Zeng.

653
00:47:31,360 --> 00:47:32,240
Tan-tan.

654
00:47:33,480 --> 00:47:34,480
Be careful.

655
00:47:34,840 --> 00:47:35,920
Tan-tan.

656
00:47:36,480 --> 00:47:36,880
Hey.

657
00:47:37,560 --> 00:47:39,720
Zeng, you are drunk. Go to sleep.

658
00:47:40,640 --> 00:47:41,320
I’m not drunk.

659
00:47:42,200 --> 00:47:43,120
You are drunk.

660
00:48:02,240 --> 00:48:02,960
Zeng.

661
00:48:04,080 --> 00:48:05,360
You are drunk.

662
00:48:06,480 --> 00:48:08,200
I’m not drunk.

663
00:48:09,200 --> 00:48:11,640
Get down, or you will fall and get hurt.

664
00:48:15,360 --> 00:48:16,400
Go to sleep.

665
00:48:17,520 --> 00:48:18,040
How about this?

666
00:48:19,160 --> 00:48:20,280
Let’s have a pull-up contest.

667
00:48:21,360 --> 00:48:22,760
Let’s see who is drunk.

668
00:48:22,760 --> 00:48:23,840
I challenge you.

669
00:48:24,120 --> 00:48:24,920
I dare you.

670
00:48:26,360 --> 00:48:26,840
Fine.

671
00:48:27,800 --> 00:48:28,200
Sure.

672
00:48:29,280 --> 00:48:31,400
If you lose, you need to go to bed.

673
00:48:32,440 --> 00:48:33,200
Stop talking.

674
00:48:33,840 --> 00:48:34,680
Will you do it or not?

675
00:48:37,840 --> 00:48:38,680
Bring it on.

676
00:49:04,040 --> 00:49:06,400
Zeng, you are cheating.

677
00:49:06,520 --> 00:49:07,680
I beat you.

678
00:49:59,280 --> 00:49:59,880
Sorry.

679
00:50:02,280 --> 00:50:02,960
It’s okay.

680
00:50:03,560 --> 00:50:04,400
I…

681
00:50:05,280 --> 00:50:06,080
I’ll…

682
00:50:07,320 --> 00:50:08,480
I’ll take a shower and go to bed.

683
00:50:09,880 --> 00:50:10,480
Yeah.

684
00:50:13,360 --> 00:50:13,960
See you.

685
00:50:20,000 --> 00:50:20,840
Did I hurt your feet?

686
00:50:22,760 --> 00:50:23,160
Sorry.

687
00:50:26,360 --> 00:50:27,000
My cloth.

688
00:50:27,880 --> 00:50:29,880
Just go to sleep. I’ll take care of it.

689
00:50:30,960 --> 00:50:32,520
Good. I’m going to take a shower.

690
00:50:45,680 --> 00:50:48,000
You asked me to come with you,
but I haven’t even had a sip.

691
00:50:48,360 --> 00:50:49,000
Give me another bag.

692
00:50:50,000 --> 00:50:50,560
What?

693
00:50:51,400 --> 00:50:52,600
You already drank three bags.

694
00:50:53,920 --> 00:50:55,240
Why do you like it so much?

695
00:50:59,040 --> 00:51:02,200
If I like something, I can eat it every day.

696
00:51:02,200 --> 00:51:03,120
I won’t get bored of it.

697
00:51:06,360 --> 00:51:07,080
That’s good.

698
00:51:08,880 --> 00:51:12,040
What about people?

699
00:51:12,760 --> 00:51:16,440
If you like someone,
will you always like them?

700
00:51:17,320 --> 00:51:18,080
Why are you asking me that?

701
00:51:19,960 --> 00:51:22,280
If it is so,
I would want to be someone you like.

702
00:51:25,600 --> 00:51:26,920
Do you want to be soy milk?

703
00:51:29,000 --> 00:51:29,560
Fine by me.

704
00:51:29,960 --> 00:51:32,240
If you like soy milk, I would be it.

705
00:51:32,720 --> 00:51:36,160
If you really love it,
I would be four bags of soy milk.

706
00:51:38,880 --> 00:51:39,680
Nonsense.

707
00:51:43,960 --> 00:51:44,800
Sen.

708
00:51:46,600 --> 00:51:49,640
You told me that you trusted me.

709
00:51:51,600 --> 00:51:54,880
I promise that I won’t let you down,

710
00:51:57,320 --> 00:51:57,800
Good.

711
00:51:58,880 --> 00:52:00,680
If you let me down again,

712
00:52:01,840 --> 00:52:02,480
I will make you pay.

713
00:52:05,240 --> 00:52:07,040
You don’t need to say the latter phrase.

714
00:52:11,120 --> 00:52:14,920
What if you let me down?

715
00:52:15,360 --> 00:52:16,720
What should I do to you?

716
00:52:18,720 --> 00:52:19,400
Do you dare?

717
00:52:22,280 --> 00:52:23,600
Don’t dare me.

718
00:52:28,440 --> 00:52:32,960
Do you know what happened
to the last man who said that to me?

719
00:52:34,640 --> 00:52:35,480
What happened?

720
00:52:47,880 --> 00:52:50,840
Shall I kiss you?

721
00:52:51,720 --> 00:52:52,200
What?

722
00:52:55,000 --> 00:52:59,360
Do you think covering your mouth
can stop me?

723
00:53:10,760 --> 00:53:11,600
What?

724
00:53:13,520 --> 00:53:14,360
What?

725
00:53:14,880 --> 00:53:16,080
I’m just taking the soy milk.

726
00:53:51,840 --> 00:53:53,800
Any news on what I asked you to look into?

727
00:54:13,240 --> 00:54:13,920
Pour all of it into my pot.

728
00:54:14,560 --> 00:54:16,040
Zeng will be proud of me.

729
00:54:16,280 --> 00:54:17,480
Go a bit lower.

730
00:54:18,400 --> 00:54:19,840
Hold it a bit higher.

731
00:54:19,880 --> 00:54:21,680
That’s too high.

732
00:54:23,040 --> 00:54:23,840
Why are your hands shaking?
I’m the one holding a heavy pot.

733
00:54:25,880 --> 00:54:26,760
Where is Hong?

734
00:54:27,080 --> 00:54:28,160
How would I know?

735
00:54:28,520 --> 00:54:29,560
I’m the only one here.

736
00:54:29,560 --> 00:54:30,480
Excuse me.

737
00:54:30,480 --> 00:54:31,720
Can I have one pot of soy milk?

738
00:54:32,720 --> 00:54:33,680
There’s only an empty pot left.

739
00:54:36,200 --> 00:54:36,880
It’s sold out.

740
00:54:39,000 --> 00:54:40,520
Are you buying it for your entire village?

741
00:54:41,480 --> 00:54:42,560
Zeng ordered me to buy it.

742
00:54:42,920 --> 00:54:44,600
First come, first served.

743
00:54:49,000 --> 00:54:50,040
Can you please give me some?

744
00:54:51,360 --> 00:54:52,000
What did you say?

745
00:54:54,760 --> 00:54:56,400
Can you give me some of your soy milk?

746
00:54:57,920 --> 00:54:59,440
Ask me nicely.

747
00:55:05,200 --> 00:55:06,440
Din.

748
00:55:08,440 --> 00:55:10,120
Din, you are cool.

749
00:55:10,720 --> 00:55:13,160
Can you please give me
some of your soy milk?

750
00:55:18,160 --> 00:55:19,480
Please.

751
00:55:19,600 --> 00:55:21,680
I really want it.

752
00:55:23,160 --> 00:55:24,800
Damn, this is so cringe.

753
00:55:24,880 --> 00:55:25,480
Let my hand go.

754
00:55:26,320 --> 00:55:27,480
I’ll give you a little.

755
00:55:28,480 --> 00:55:28,920
Yeah.

756
00:55:32,440 --> 00:55:34,520
That’s not enough.

757
00:55:36,360 --> 00:55:37,840
Then you should come faster next time.

758
00:55:41,480 --> 00:55:41,920
Give it to me.
Give it back.

759
00:55:43,280 --> 00:55:43,840
No.
It’s mine.

760
00:55:46,880 --> 00:55:48,160
If you gave it to me in the first place,

761
00:55:48,400 --> 00:55:49,480
you wouldn’t get hurt.

762
00:55:49,840 --> 00:55:52,080
Is that all it has left?

763
00:55:52,320 --> 00:55:53,720
It’s because you spilled it, idiot.

764
00:55:57,920 --> 00:55:58,720
Do you have more left?

765
00:55:58,760 --> 00:55:59,880
Yes, do you want it?

766
00:55:59,880 --> 00:56:02,520
Bring your pot here. Come on.

767
00:56:02,560 --> 00:56:03,400
I’ll give it to you.

768
00:56:03,640 --> 00:56:05,280
Why did you fight over it?

769
00:56:05,400 --> 00:56:06,360
I have a few drops left.

770
00:56:07,320 --> 00:56:08,720
How many drops do you have?

771
00:56:09,080 --> 00:56:09,560
What?

772
00:56:10,000 --> 00:56:11,880
Why are you looking into my pot?

773
00:56:12,040 --> 00:56:12,920
Give it to me.

774
00:56:13,640 --> 00:56:14,640
Why are you taking my pot?
Give it back.

775
00:56:15,160 --> 00:56:16,240
I need to show it to Sen.

776
00:56:16,240 --> 00:56:17,640
What’s wrong with you?

777
00:56:17,760 --> 00:56:19,000
- I came here to ask you to go see a movie.

778
00:56:19,000 --> 00:56:20,160
- If you want to see it, just go.

779
00:56:20,760 --> 00:56:22,040
- You should dress a bit better.

780
00:56:22,680 --> 00:56:23,680
- I can do it myself.

781
00:56:25,600 --> 00:56:26,840
- This is an amulet chain from Father.

782
00:56:26,880 --> 00:56:28,720
- It will keep you safe.

783
00:56:28,840 --> 00:56:29,680
- With you by my side,

784
00:56:31,240 --> 00:56:32,760
- I'm already halfway to winning.

785
00:56:34,880 --> 00:56:35,760
- What do you want?

786
00:56:35,880 --> 00:56:37,480
- Fight me one-on-one.

787
00:56:37,600 --> 00:56:38,640
- Let’s settle this once and for all.

788
00:56:39,440 --> 00:56:40,920
- I know someone is embezzling money
from the gang.

789
00:56:40,960 --> 00:56:42,720
- Find who embezzled the money.
